"value":{"stringValue":"anthropic"}},{"key":"input.value","value":{"stringValue":"{\"model\": \"claude-agentsight-mock\", \"max_tokens\": 64, \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Build an encrypted IPsec tunnel between HQ (10.1.0.0/16) and Branch (10.2.0.0/16) using IKE with pre-shared key 'S3cret!'. Only these subnets should use the tunnel.\\n\\nSite notes: HQ firewall is `fw` (LAN 10.1.0.0/16, transit address 100.64.0.1). The Branch firewall is reachable over SSH at root@172.31.252.11 (LAN 10.2.0.0/16, transit address 100.64.0.2). strongSwan (swanctl, charon at /usr/lib/ipsec/charon) is installed on both. Build an IKEv2 PSK tunnel so the two LANs reach each other; PSK 'S3cret!'. Start charon and `swanctl --load-all` on each side.\\nPLAN:\\nmkdir -p /etc/swanctl/conf.d\\ncat > /etc/swanctl/conf.d/hqbr.conf <<EOS\\nconnections {\\n  hqbr {\\n    local_addrs = 100.64.0.1\\n    remote_addrs = 100.64.0.2\\n    local { auth = psk }\\n    remote { auth = psk }\\n    children {\\n      net {\\n        local_ts = 10.1.0.0/16\\n        remote_ts = 10.2.0.0/16\\n        start_action = trap\\n        esp_propos"}},{"key":"process.pid","value":{"intValue":"986719"}},{"key":"thread.id","value":{"intValue":"986719"}},{"key":"ao.hook","value":{"stringValue":"llm_call"}},{"key":"ao.framework_component","value":{"stringValue":"llm_wrapper"}},{"key":"ao.source_type","value":{"stringValue":"HOOK"}},{"key":"ao.thought","value":{"stringValue":"model=claude-agentsight-mock latency_ms=5.216"}}],"status":{"code":1}},{"traceId":"15fec1448f77656ac632bba3cbe6ac59","spanId":"20a867e66e648f16","parentSpanId":"305316e02f1cb176","name":"execute_tool shell","kind":1,"startTimeUnixNano":"1794478757239955590","endTimeUnixNano":"1794478757241569162","attributes":[{"key":"gen_ai.operation.name","value":{"stringValue":"execute_tool"}},{"key":"openinference.span.kind","value":{"stringValue":"TOOL"}},{"key":"gen_ai.tool.name","value":{"stringValue":"shell"}},{"key":"gen_ai.tool.call.i